{"data":{"body":"[P2] On the agent-deferred path, `execCtx.traceFlags()` is deliberately provisional (sampled) until starting `invocationSpan` resolves the installed sampler. If it returns `RECORD_ONLY`, this placeholder remains sampled while the exported Workflow span is unsampled, so operation parents/links contain inconsistent sampling metadata. Construct the Workflow context after `invocationSpan` starts, using its resolved flags; apply the same fix in `InvocationOtelPlugin`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7mh7rF","finding_digest":"99794a0b1deff3d0cfd24f8b92e497d2c80ebb78448c911e45d0f873b10bf09f","finding_id":"arf_v1_tf4uucy557z5bt6sj6fzfzex2l","finding_key":"otel-plugin/executionotelplugin::oninvocationstart::workflow-context-sampling-consistency","identity_key":"otel-plugin/executionotelplugin::oninvocationstart::workflow-context-sampling-consistency","line":262,"observation_digest":"b60baf6500c793e9826f3544236f4bc3cde8c13aaddb0899e3bb740056b3375b","observation_id":"aro_v1_wyf26ziay6j6tatpgvccg32lyp","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/ExecutionOtelPlugin.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-27T00:03:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jdik6h3ycsz7w7wiwt3wpy56vi","reviewed_base_sha":"39d11d9532d22382048da49f3f56c053ceaf1320","reviewed_head_sha":"af20a3459574c5e7e4d0b1e5a0e220ff5cd6c842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":261,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":650},"record_id":"art_v1_xjr3fqbkhlhy5z7r54ekmihm6r","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-27T00:03:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
